ame":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Un bon footing, il n'y a que ça de vrai pour évacuer le stress ou tout simplement profiter pour s'évader de ton quotidien, profite de ton environnement et pense au plaisir simple que la course t'apporte ! Ça fait du bien de se recentrer sur les petits plaisirs simples de temps en temps ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.871720116618076,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_1","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **6 répétitions de 3'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 1'30 de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"On attaque le seuil 60 aujourd'hui, l'allure que tu serais capable de tenir pendant 60 minutes au total si tu étais 100% reposé(e) et en fin de préparation. On n'en est pas encore là, mais on va t'y emmener progressivement. Profite bien de ce nouveau cycle d'entraînement, moins tu manqueras de séances de seuil, plus tu pourras profiter des bénéfices exceptionnels de ce cycle !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":90,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.63533889587316,"expectedDuration":2820},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"