:"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le mot d'ordre : relax ! La séance d'endurance fondamentale, c'est celle où il faut en profiter pour te détendre pour bien récupérer du fractionné. Aller trop vite sur cette séance est contre-productif, ne tombe pas dans le piège !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.871720116618076,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_2","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **5 répétitions de 4'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"L'erreur serait de laisser la fatigue prendre le dessus sur ton efficacité. Plus la séance avance, plus tu fatigues. Plus tu fatigues moins tu fais attention à ta posture, ton souffle, ton gainage. Cela double la fatigue ! Donc concentre-toi sur tous tes intervalles et ne dégrade pas ta technique.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"