":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Vas-y mollo aujourd'hui car avec les belles séances de fractionné que tu fais en ce moment, il faut s'assurer de ne pas te fatiguer plus que de raison pour éviter les blessures !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.894736842105263,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_3_Alternative1","description":"Séance de S60 (sans S60), en \"over/under\", où l'on va encadrer la vitesse cible. Elle est composée de **4 séries** de 5' avec 2' de repos entre chaque série. Chaque 5' est composée de **2' au S30 suivi par 3' au SweetSpot, enchainé sans repos**. ","displayName":"Séance S60 alternative : \"Big Five\"","coachAdvice":"Mettre des petites accélérations en course c'est la signature des coureurs Kenyans. Reproduire cette variation d'allure poncutellement à l'entrainement a pour avantage d'apprendre à maitriser différentes allures sans récupération et ainsi d'étendre notre zone de confort.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":241,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":268,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.991060439319456,"expectedDuration":2880},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":268}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":268}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":268}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":268}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_85_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif de 28' en continu est composé de 10' d'endurance active, 15' Tempo et 3' au Sweetspot pour terminer.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"La sortie longue continue d'augmenter de quelques minutes, on est toujours dans une durée qui doit être facile grâce à la progression de la distance semaine après semaine. Si c'est le cas, tant mieux, tu suis exactement la progression désirée ! Sinon, peut-être que tu as couru un peu plus vite que prévu ? 5 ou 10 secondes /km trop vite sur ces durées, ça commence logiquement à se faire sentir donc si c'est ton cas, attention ! :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_45","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Aerobie_10","exerciseType":"runni