sures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"S'il y a un moment où tu peux travailler ta technique de course, c'est bien en footing ! Prends le temps de penser à un détail que tu souhaites améliorer (voir ici pour 10 points techniques intéressants : https://youtu.be/pP7TCO3kqoM) et concentre toi dessus. Pas sur plusieurs, sur un seul à la fois pour que ce soit vraiment efficace !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_4","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 6'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 3' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"C'est plaisant de se dire que tu es capable chaque semaine d'en faire un peu plus sans que ce soit plus difficile non ? Doucement mais sûrement, c'est ça le vrai dicton des coureurs qui s'améliorent !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_6","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":6,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":10.361860904107743,"expectedDuration":3360},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":255}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_90_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 2 séries de 15' Tempo, séparées par 2' de repos.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Les choses sérieuses commencent vraiment avec cette sortie longue ! Pas que sur des sorties plus courtes, ce soit \"hyper facile\", mais quand tu arrives à 1h30 et p